[32m+[m[32mRecon breadth brought up toward Sn1per-parity, while keeping the authorization[m
[32m+[m[32minvariant that out-of-scope hosts are reported but never contacted:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Active subdomain brute force** joins the existing crt.sh (Certificate[m
[32m+[m[32m  Transparency) lookup in `subdomain-enum` -- a ~90-entry wordlist resolved[m
[32m+[m[32m  via DNS-over-HTTPS catches hosts that never had a logged TLS certificate.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Subdomain-takeover detection**: every resolved subdomain's CNAME is[m
