[32m+[m[32m## What's new in 0.6.1[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Fixed: bare-path `--exploit-endpoint` silently failed.** Passing `--exploit-endpoint /product/stock` (path instead of full URL) produced the hostless URL `http:///product/stock`; every exploit request then failed with a synthetic status-0 response and the direct-exploit chain quietly did nothing (no error shown). Bare paths are now resolved against the scan target (`https://<target>/product/stock`), and the console prints the resolved URL. Regression-tested (5 new tests; suite at 107).[m
