[32m+[m[32m- **Authorization UX fix.** `--i-am-authorized` alone now auto-scopes the scan to the exact target host (denylist still overrides; explicit `--authorize-host`/`--scope` still win). `--authorize-host` also accepts URLs and `host:port` and normalizes them to the hostname.[m
